1
00:04:42,857 --> 00:04:48,857
Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths Part Three is a animation,
science fiction, action film directed by Jeff Wamester.

2
00:09:25,714 --> 00:09:31,714
Now fully revealed as the ultimate threat to existence, the Anti-Monitor wages an unrelenting
attack on the surviving Earths that struggle for survival in a pocket universe.

3
00:14:08,571 --> 00:14:14,571
One by one, these worlds and all their inhabitants are vaporized!

4
00:18:51,428 --> 00:18:57,428
On the planets that remain, even time itself is shattered, and heroes from the past join
the Justice League and their rag-tag allies against the epitome of evil.

5
00:23:34,285 --> 00:23:40,285
But as they make their last stand, will the sacrifice of
the superheroes be enough to save us all?

6
00:28:17,142 --> 00:28:23,142
Batman / Bruce Wayne (voice), played by Jensen Ackles.

7
00:32:59,999 --> 00:33:05,999
Superman / Earth-2 Superman (voice), played by Darren Criss.

8
00:37:42,857 --> 00:37:48,857
Lex Luthor (voice), played by Corey Stoll.

9
00:42:25,714 --> 00:42:31,714
Batgirl (voice), played by Gideon Adlon.

10
00:47:08,571 --> 00:47:14,571
Martian Manhunter / J'onn J'onzz (voice), played by Ike Amadi.

11
00:51:51,428 --> 00:51:57,428
Psycho Pirate / Charles Halstead (voice), played by Geoffrey Arend.

12
00:56:34,285 --> 00:56:40,285
Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths is a 2024 American animated superhero film trilogy featuring the DC Comics superhero team the Justice
League and based on the DC Comics storyline Crisis on Infinite Earths (1985–1986) written by Marv Wolfman and pencilled by George Pérez.

13
01:01:17,142 --> 01:01:23,142
The films were directed by Jeff Wamester from a script by Jim Krieg.

14
01:05:59,999 --> 01:06:05,999
They are the 54th, 55th, and 56th films of the DC
Universe Animated Original Movies.

15
01:10:42,857 --> 01:10:48,857
They are the eighth, ninth, and tenth (and final) installments in the second phase of the DC
Animated Movie Universe, as well as the 23rd, 24th, and 25th (and final) films overall.

16
01:15:25,714 --> 01:15:31,714
Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths – Part
One was released on January 9, 2024.

17
01:20:08,571 --> 01:20:14,571
Part Two was released on April 23, and Part Three was released on July 16.

18
01:24:51,428 --> 01:24:57,428
The films were dedicated to comic artist George Pérez who died on May 6, 2022, and
longtime Batman actor Kevin Conroy who died later that same year on November 10.

19
01:29:34,285 --> 01:29:40,285
The film explores themes of superhero, end of the world, based on
graphic novel, superhero team, parallel universe.

20
01:34:17,142 --> 01:34:23,142
The tone is thought_provoking.
